{
 "coordinator overview": "\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h2>Gezinnen beheren</h2>\n      <p class=\"muted\">Vul of wijzig gegevens namens een andere ouder. Telefoonnummers en uitnodigingscode staan onder \"Wijzig\", net als de coördinator-koppeling. Het oog-icoon toont de app zoals deze ouder hem ziet.</p>\n      \n      \n    <div class=\"rowflex\" style=\"padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);gap:8px\">\n      <div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:800\">Anouk</div>\n        <div class=\"muted\">Kees de Vries  </div>\n        \n      </div>\n      <span style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-shrink:0\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn small secondary\" data-coordedit=\"f3\">Wijzig</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"iconbtn\" data-imptest=\"f3\" aria-label=\"Test de app als Kees de Vries\" title=\"Testweergave als deze ouder\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" style=\"width:1em;height:1em;vertical-align:-0.15em;flex-shrink:0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 128 Q128 32 240 128 Q128 224 16 128 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"128\" cy=\"128\" r=\"32\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\"/></svg></button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"iconbtn danger\" data-coorddel=\"f3\" aria-label=\"Verwijder Anouk\" title=\"Verwijder\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" style=\"width:1em;height:1em;vertical-align:-0.15em;flex-shrink:0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M56 64h144l-12 144a8 8 0 0 1-8 8H76a8 8 0 0 1-8-8Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"216\" y2=\"64\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M96 64V48a16 16 0 0 1 16-16h32a16 16 0 0 1 16 16v16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\"/></svg></button>\n      </span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"rowflex\" style=\"padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);gap:8px\">\n      <div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:800\">Eline</div>\n        <div class=\"muted\">Jan Jansen  <span class=\"badge rec\">COÖRDINATOR</span></div>\n        <div class=\"fitbad\" style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:2px\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" style=\"width:1em;height:1em;vertical-align:-0.15em;flex-shrink:0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M236 208H20a8 8 0 0 1-7-11.9L121 44.5a8 8 0 0 1 14 0l108 151.6a8 8 0 0 1-7 11.9Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><line x1=\"128\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"128\" y2=\"144\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"128\" cy=\"172\" r=\"10\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg> Geen code</div>\n      </div>\n      <span style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-shrink:0\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn small secondary\" data-coordedit=\"f1\">Wijzig</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"iconbtn\" data-imptest=\"f1\" aria-label=\"Test de app als Jan Jansen\" title=\"Testweergave als deze ouder\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" style=\"width:1em;height:1em;vertical-align:-0.15em;flex-shrink:0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 128 Q128 32 240 128 Q128 224 16 128 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"128\" cy=\"128\" r=\"32\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\"/></svg></button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"iconbtn danger\" data-coorddel=\"f1\" aria-label=\"Verwijder Eline\" title=\"Verwijder\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" style=\"width:1em;height:1em;vertical-align:-0.15em;flex-shrink:0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M56 64h144l-12 144a8 8 0 0 1-8 8H76a8 8 0 0 1-8-8Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"216\" y2=\"64\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M96 64V48a16 16 0 0 1 16-16h32a16 16 0 0 1 16 16v16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\"/></svg></button>\n      </span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"rowflex\" style=\"padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);gap:8px\">\n      <div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:800\">Evi</div>\n        <div class=\"muted\">Mo Bakker  </div>\n        <div class=\"fitbad\" style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:2px\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" style=\"width:1em;height:1em;vertical-align:-0.15em;flex-shrink:0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M236 208H20a8 8 0 0 1-7-11.9L121 44.5a8 8 0 0 1 14 0l108 151.6a8 8 0 0 1-7 11.9Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><line x1=\"128\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"128\" y2=\"144\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"128\" cy=\"172\" r=\"10\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg> Geen code</div>\n      </div>\n      <span style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-shrink:0\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn small secondary\" data-coordedit=\"f4\">Wijzig</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"iconbtn\" data-imptest=\"f4\" aria-label=\"Test de app als Mo Bakker\" title=\"Testweergave als deze ouder\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" style=\"width:1em;height:1em;vertical-align:-0.15em;flex-shrink:0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 128 Q128 32 240 128 Q128 224 16 128 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"128\" cy=\"128\" r=\"32\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\"/></svg></button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"iconbtn danger\" data-coorddel=\"f4\" aria-label=\"Verwijder Evi\" title=\"Verwijder\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" style=\"width:1em;height:1em;vertical-align:-0.15em;flex-shrink:0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M56 64h144l-12 144a8 8 0 0 1-8 8H76a8 8 0 0 1-8-8Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"216\" y2=\"64\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M96 64V48a16 16 0 0 1 16-16h32a16 16 0 0 1 16 16v16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\"/></svg></button>\n      </span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"rowflex\" style=\"padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);gap:8px\">\n      <div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:800\">Jahaimy</div>\n        <div class=\"muted\">Piet Pieters <span class=\"badge\">gekoppeld</span> </div>\n        <div class=\"fitbad\" style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:2px\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" style=\"width:1em;height:1em;vertical-align:-0.15em;flex-shrink:0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M236 208H20a8 8 0 0 1-7-11.9L121 44.5a8 8 0 0 1 14 0l108 151.6a8 8 0 0 1-7 11.9Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><line x1=\"128\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"128\" y2=\"144\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"128\" cy=\"172\" r=\"10\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg> Geen code</div>\n      </div>\n      <span style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-shrink:0\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn small secondary\" data-coordedit=\"f2\">Wijzig</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"iconbtn\" data-imptest=\"f2\" aria-label=\"Test de app als Piet Pieters\" title=\"Testweergave als deze ouder\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" style=\"width:1em;height:1em;vertical-align:-0.15em;flex-shrink:0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 128 Q128 32 240 128 Q128 224 16 128 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"128\" cy=\"128\" r=\"32\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\"/></svg></button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"iconbtn danger\" data-coorddel=\"f2\" aria-label=\"Verwijder Jahaimy\" title=\"Verwijder\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" style=\"width:1em;height:1em;vertical-align:-0.15em;flex-shrink:0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M56 64h144l-12 144a8 8 0 0 1-8 8H76a8 8 0 0 1-8-8Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"216\" y2=\"64\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M96 64V48a16 16 0 0 1 16-16h32a16 16 0 0 1 16 16v16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\"/></svg></button>\n      </span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"rowflex\" style=\"padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);gap:8px\">\n      <div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:800\">Lois</div>\n        <div class=\"muted\">Sanne Smit  </div>\n        <div class=\"fitbad\" style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:2px\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" style=\"width:1em;height:1em;vertical-align:-0.15em;flex-shrink:0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M236 208H20a8 8 0 0 1-7-11.9L121 44.5a8 8 0 0 1 14 0l108 151.6a8 8 0 0 1-7 11.9Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><line x1=\"128\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"128\" y2=\"144\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"128\" cy=\"172\" r=\"10\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg> Geen code</div>\n      </div>\n      <span style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-shrink:0\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn small secondary\" data-coordedit=\"f5\">Wijzig</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"iconbtn\" data-imptest=\"f5\" aria-label=\"Test de app als Sanne Smit\" title=\"Testweergave als deze ouder\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" style=\"width:1em;height:1em;vertical-align:-0.15em;flex-shrink:0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 128 Q128 32 240 128 Q128 224 16 128 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"128\" cy=\"128\" r=\"32\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\"/></svg></button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"iconbtn danger\" data-coorddel=\"f5\" aria-label=\"Verwijder Lois\" title=\"Verwijder\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" style=\"width:1em;height:1em;vertical-align:-0.15em;flex-shrink:0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M56 64h144l-12 144a8 8 0 0 1-8 8H76a8 8 0 0 1-8-8Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"216\" y2=\"64\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M96 64V48a16 16 0 0 1 16-16h32a16 16 0 0 1 16 16v16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\"/></svg></button>\n      </span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"rowflex\" style=\"padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);gap:8px\">\n      <div style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\">\n        <div style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:800\">Saar</div>\n        <div class=\"muted\">Tom Visser  </div>\n        <div class=\"fitbad\" style=\"font-size:12px;margin-top:2px\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" style=\"width:1em;height:1em;vertical-align:-0.15em;flex-shrink:0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M236 208H20a8 8 0 0 1-7-11.9L121 44.5a8 8 0 0 1 14 0l108 151.6a8 8 0 0 1-7 11.9Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><line x1=\"128\" y1=\"104\" x2=\"128\" y2=\"144\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"128\" cy=\"172\" r=\"10\" fill=\"currentColor\"/></svg> Geen code</div>\n      </div>\n      <span style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-shrink:0\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn small secondary\" data-coordedit=\"f6\">Wijzig</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"iconbtn\" data-imptest=\"f6\" aria-label=\"Test de app als Tom Visser\" title=\"Testweergave als deze ouder\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" style=\"width:1em;height:1em;vertical-align:-0.15em;flex-shrink:0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M16 128 Q128 32 240 128 Q128 224 16 128 Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><circle cx=\"128\" cy=\"128\" r=\"32\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\"/></svg></button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"iconbtn danger\" data-coorddel=\"f6\" aria-label=\"Verwijder Saar\" title=\"Verwijder\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" style=\"width:1em;height:1em;vertical-align:-0.15em;flex-shrink:0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M56 64h144l-12 144a8 8 0 0 1-8 8H76a8 8 0 0 1-8-8Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"216\" y2=\"64\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M96 64V48a16 16 0 0 1 16-16h32a16 16 0 0 1 16 16v16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\"/></svg></button>\n      </span>\n    </div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn secondary\" id=\"coordNew\">+ Nieuw gezin toevoegen</button>\n      <div id=\"coordEditArea\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h2>Selectievolgorde per shift</h2>\n      <p class=\"muted\">Bepaal per shift in welke volgorde beschikbare chauffeurs worden voorgesteld.</p>\n    <label>Shift</label><select id=\"shiftPrioritySelect\"><option value=\"Ma_heen\" selected>Maandag – Heen</option><option value=\"Ma_terug\" >Maandag – Terug</option><option value=\"Di_heen\" >Dinsdag – Heen</option><option value=\"Di_terug\" >Dinsdag – Terug</option><option value=\"Wo_heen\" >Woensdag – Heen</option><option value=\"Wo_terug\" >Woensdag – Terug</option><option value=\"Do_heen\" >Donderdag – Heen</option><option value=\"Do_terug\" >Donderdag – Terug</option><option value=\"Vr_heen\" >Vrijdag – Heen</option><option value=\"Vr_terug\" >Vrijdag – Terug</option></select>\n    <div id=\"shiftPriorityRows\" style=\"margin-top:8px\"></div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h2>Reisvoorkeuren</h2>\n      <p class=\"muted\">Wie er logistiek het beste samen in 1 auto kan; wordt meegewogen bij het opsplitsen in auto's.</p>\n      <p class=\"muted\">Nog geen voorkeuren.</p>\n    <hr style=\"border:none;border-top:1px solid var(--border);margin:12px 0\">\n    <p class=\"muted\"><strong>Samen reizen</strong> (moeten altijd samen in 1 auto als het even kan):</p>\n    <div><label class=\"chip\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"prefTogetherPick\" value=\"f3\">Anouk</label><label class=\"chip\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"prefTogetherPick\" value=\"f1\">Eline</label><label class=\"chip\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"prefTogetherPick\" value=\"f4\">Evi</label><label class=\"chip\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"prefTogetherPick\" value=\"f2\">Jahaimy</label><label class=\"chip\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"prefTogetherPick\" value=\"f5\">Lois</label><label class=\"chip\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"prefTogetherPick\" value=\"f6\">Saar</label></div>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn small secondary\" id=\"addTogetherPref\">+ Toevoegen</button>\n    <p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><strong>Voorkeur</strong> (moet met minstens één van de gekozen meiden):</p>\n    <label>Wie</label><select id=\"preferGirlSelect\"><option value=\"f3\">Anouk</option><option value=\"f1\">Eline</option><option value=\"f4\">Evi</option><option value=\"f2\">Jahaimy</option><option value=\"f5\">Lois</option><option value=\"f6\">Saar</option></select>\n    <label>Bij voorkeur met (kies één of meer)</label><div><label class=\"chip\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"prefWithPick\" value=\"f3\">Anouk</label><label class=\"chip\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"prefWithPick\" value=\"f1\">Eline</label><label class=\"chip\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"prefWithPick\" value=\"f4\">Evi</label><label class=\"chip\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"prefWithPick\" value=\"f2\">Jahaimy</label><label class=\"chip\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"prefWithPick\" value=\"f5\">Lois</label><label class=\"chip\"><input type=\"checkbox\" class=\"prefWithPick\" value=\"f6\">Saar</label></div>\n    <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn small secondary\" id=\"addPreferPref\">+ Toevoegen</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\" id=\"backupCard\">\n      <h2>Back-up gezinnen</h2>\n      <p class=\"muted\">Sla alle gezinnen op in één bestand (CSV, te openen in Excel) of zet een eerder bestand terug. Het bestand bevat per gezin: ouder, dochter, type, coördinator (j/n), autocapaciteit, telefoonnummers, de heen- en terugtijden en de beschikbaarheid (beschikbaar of back-up) per dag. Uitnodigingscodes en koppelingen staan er bewust niet in.</p>\n      <div class=\"rowflex\" style=\"gap:8px;justify-content:flex-start;flex-wrap:wrap\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn secondary\" id=\"backupMake\">Back-up maken</button>\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn secondary\" id=\"backupRestore\">Terugzetten uit bestand…</button>\n        <input type=\"file\" id=\"backupFile\" accept=\".csv,text/csv,text/plain\" style=\"display:none\">\n      </div>\n      \n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\" id=\"dayCoordCard\">\n      <h2>Dagcoördinatoren</h2>\n      <p class=\"muted\">Kies per weekdag welke ouder wijzigingen in de carpool afhandelt. Ouders zien deze naam in Rooster en Mijn week, met een WhatsApp-knop.</p>\n      <div class=\"rowflex\" style=\"align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:6px\">\n      <label style=\"margin:0;width:96px\" for=\"dayCoord_Ma\">Maandag</label>\n      <select id=\"dayCoord_Ma\" class=\"dayCoordSel\" data-coordday=\"Ma\" style=\"flex:1\">\n        <option value=\"\">-- niemand --</option>\n        <option value=\"f1\" >Jan Jansen (Eline)</option><option value=\"f3\" >Kees de Vries (Anouk)</option><option value=\"f4\" >Mo Bakker (Evi)</option><option value=\"f2\" >Piet Pieters (Jahaimy)</option><option value=\"f5\" >Sanne Smit (Lois)</option><option value=\"f6\" >Tom Visser (Saar)</option>\n      </select>\n    </div><div class=\"rowflex\" style=\"align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:6px\">\n      <label style=\"margin:0;width:96px\" for=\"dayCoord_Di\">Dinsdag</label>\n      <select id=\"dayCoord_Di\" class=\"dayCoordSel\" data-coordday=\"Di\" style=\"flex:1\">\n        <option value=\"\">-- niemand --</option>\n        <option value=\"f1\" >Jan Jansen (Eline)</option><option value=\"f3\" >Kees de Vries (Anouk)</option><option value=\"f4\" >Mo Bakker (Evi)</option><option value=\"f2\" >Piet Pieters (Jahaimy)</option><option value=\"f5\" >Sanne Smit (Lois)</option><option value=\"f6\" >Tom Visser (Saar)</option>\n      </select>\n    </div><div class=\"rowflex\" style=\"align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:6px\">\n      <label style=\"margin:0;width:96px\" for=\"dayCoord_Wo\">Woensdag</label>\n      <select id=\"dayCoord_Wo\" class=\"dayCoordSel\" data-coordday=\"Wo\" style=\"flex:1\">\n        <option value=\"\">-- niemand --</option>\n        <option value=\"f1\" >Jan Jansen (Eline)</option><option value=\"f3\" >Kees de Vries (Anouk)</option><option value=\"f4\" >Mo Bakker (Evi)</option><option value=\"f2\" >Piet Pieters (Jahaimy)</option><option value=\"f5\" >Sanne Smit (Lois)</option><option value=\"f6\" >Tom Visser (Saar)</option>\n      </select>\n    </div><div class=\"rowflex\" style=\"align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:6px\">\n      <label style=\"margin:0;width:96px\" for=\"dayCoord_Do\">Donderdag</label>\n      <select id=\"dayCoord_Do\" class=\"dayCoordSel\" data-coordday=\"Do\" style=\"flex:1\">\n        <option value=\"\">-- niemand --</option>\n        <option value=\"f1\" >Jan Jansen (Eline)</option><option value=\"f3\" >Kees de Vries (Anouk)</option><option value=\"f4\" >Mo Bakker (Evi)</option><option value=\"f2\" >Piet Pieters (Jahaimy)</option><option value=\"f5\" >Sanne Smit (Lois)</option><option value=\"f6\" >Tom Visser (Saar)</option>\n      </select>\n    </div><div class=\"rowflex\" style=\"align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-top:6px\">\n      <label style=\"margin:0;width:96px\" for=\"dayCoord_Vr\">Vrijdag</label>\n      <select id=\"dayCoord_Vr\" class=\"dayCoordSel\" data-coordday=\"Vr\" style=\"flex:1\">\n        <option value=\"\">-- niemand --</option>\n        <option value=\"f1\" >Jan Jansen (Eline)</option><option value=\"f3\" >Kees de Vries (Anouk)</option><option value=\"f4\" >Mo Bakker (Evi)</option><option value=\"f2\" >Piet Pieters (Jahaimy)</option><option value=\"f5\" >Sanne Smit (Lois)</option><option value=\"f6\" >Tom Visser (Saar)</option>\n      </select>\n    </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\" id=\"noticeCard\">\n      <h2>Melding voor iedereen</h2>\n      <p class=\"muted\">Een korte melding als dunne gele balk bovenaan de app, zichtbaar voor alle gebruikers. Jij zet hem aan en uit.</p>\n      <label class=\"switchRow\" for=\"noticeOn\"><span>Melding tonen</span>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"switch\" class=\"noticeInput switch\" id=\"noticeOn\"></label>\n      <label for=\"noticeText\">Tekst</label>\n      <input type=\"text\" class=\"noticeInput\" id=\"noticeText\" maxlength=\"100\" autocomplete=\"off\" value=\"\" placeholder=\"Bijvoorbeeld: Zaterdag geen training.\">\n      <div class=\"muted noticeCount\" id=\"noticeCount\">0 / 100</div>\n      <label style=\"margin-top:10px\">Automatisch uit op (niet verplicht)</label>\n      <div class=\"rowflex\" style=\"gap:8px\">\n        <input type=\"date\" class=\"noticeInput\" id=\"noticeOffDate\" aria-label=\"Datum waarop de melding uitgaat\" value=\"\">\n        <input type=\"time\" class=\"noticeInput\" id=\"noticeOffTime\" aria-label=\"Tijd waarop de melding uitgaat\" value=\"\">\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:3px\">Laat leeg om de melding aan te laten tot je hem zelf uitzet.</p>\n      <label>Zo ziet iedereen het</label>\n      <div class=\"noticePreview\" id=\"noticePreview\"><div class=\"muted\" style=\"padding:6px 12px;font-size:12px\">Nog geen tekst.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"rowflex\" style=\"gap:8px;margin-top:10px;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\"><span class=\"noticeChip off\">Uit, niet zichtbaar</span></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn\" id=\"noticeSave\" style=\"width:100%\">Opslaan</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\" id=\"periodCard\">\n      <h2>Perioden met andere tijden</h2>\n      <p class=\"muted\">Ouders geven voor een periode één keer hun tijden door. Het vaste rooster blijft staan. Je kunt meerdere perioden hebben, ook als de ene nog loopt terwijl je de volgende al uitzet. Perioden mogen geen dag delen.</p>\n      <p class=\"muted\" id=\"periodPhase\">Nog geen periode ingesteld.</p>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn small secondary\" id=\"periodAdd\" data-plistadd style=\"margin-top:10px\">+ Periode toevoegen</button>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\" id=\"locationsCard\">\n      <h2>Ophaal- en afzetplekken</h2>\n      <p class=\"muted\">Ouders halen hun dochter op of zetten haar af op één van deze plekken (maximaal 6). Vul een adres in, of GPS-coördinaten: decimale graden (52.2589, 4.7673) of graden-minuten-seconden (52°15'32.3\"N 4°46'02.3\"E). Per rit kan de plek eenmalig worden gewijzigd in Wijzigen.</p>\n      <div class=\"grid2\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">\n      <div><label style=\"margin-top:0\" for=\"locName_busstation\">Naam in het rooster</label><input type=\"text\" class=\"locInput\" id=\"locName_busstation\" value=\"Busstation\"></div>\n      <div><label style=\"margin-top:0\" for=\"locAddr_busstation\">Exact adres</label>\n        <div class=\"rowflex\" style=\"gap:6px\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"locInput\" id=\"locAddr_busstation\" value=\"\" placeholder=\"Adres of GPS-coördinaten\" style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\"></div></div>\n    </div><div class=\"grid2\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">\n      <div><label style=\"margin-top:0\" for=\"locName_a4-de-hoek\">Naam in het rooster</label><input type=\"text\" class=\"locInput\" id=\"locName_a4-de-hoek\" value=\"A4-De Hoek\"></div>\n      <div><label style=\"margin-top:0\" for=\"locAddr_a4-de-hoek\">Exact adres</label>\n        <div class=\"rowflex\" style=\"gap:6px\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"locInput\" id=\"locAddr_a4-de-hoek\" value=\"\" placeholder=\"Adres of GPS-coördinaten\" style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"iconbtn danger locRemove\" data-locremove=\"a4-de-hoek\" aria-label=\"Verwijder plek A4-De Hoek\" title=\"Verwijder plek A4-De Hoek\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" style=\"width:1em;height:1em;vertical-align:-0.15em;flex-shrink:0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M56 64h144l-12 144a8 8 0 0 1-8 8H76a8 8 0 0 1-8-8Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"216\" y2=\"64\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M96 64V48a16 16 0 0 1 16-16h32a16 16 0 0 1 16 16v16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\"/></svg></button></div></div>\n    </div><div class=\"grid2\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">\n      <div><label style=\"margin-top:0\" for=\"locName_de-parel\">Naam in het rooster</label><input type=\"text\" class=\"locInput\" id=\"locName_de-parel\" value=\"De Parel\"></div>\n      <div><label style=\"margin-top:0\" for=\"locAddr_de-parel\">Exact adres</label>\n        <div class=\"rowflex\" style=\"gap:6px\"><input type=\"text\" class=\"locInput\" id=\"locAddr_de-parel\" value=\"\" placeholder=\"Adres of GPS-coördinaten\" style=\"flex:1;min-width:0\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"iconbtn danger locRemove\" data-locremove=\"de-parel\" aria-label=\"Verwijder plek De Parel\" title=\"Verwijder plek De Parel\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" style=\"width:1em;height:1em;vertical-align:-0.15em;flex-shrink:0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M56 64h144l-12 144a8 8 0 0 1-8 8H76a8 8 0 0 1-8-8Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"216\" y2=\"64\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M96 64V48a16 16 0 0 1 16-16h32a16 16 0 0 1 16 16v16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\"/></svg></button></div></div>\n    </div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn small secondary\" id=\"locAdd\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">+ Plek toevoegen</button>\n      <div class=\"grid2\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">\n        <div><label style=\"margin-top:0\" for=\"locDestName\">Bestemming in Alkmaar</label><input type=\"text\" class=\"locInput\" id=\"locDestName\" value=\"AFC &#39;34\"></div>\n        <div><label style=\"margin-top:0\" for=\"locDestAddr\">Exact adres</label><input type=\"text\" class=\"locInput\" id=\"locDestAddr\" value=\"\" placeholder=\"Straat 1, Alkmaar\"></div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"grid2\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">\n        <div><label style=\"margin-top:0\" for=\"locDefHeen\">Standaard ophaalplek (heen)</label><select class=\"locInput\" id=\"locDefHeen\"><option value=\"busstation\" selected>Busstation</option><option value=\"a4-de-hoek\" >A4-De Hoek</option><option value=\"de-parel\" >De Parel</option></select></div>\n        <div><label style=\"margin-top:0\" for=\"locDefTerug\">Standaard afzetplek (terug)</label><select class=\"locInput\" id=\"locDefTerug\"><option value=\"busstation\" selected>Busstation</option><option value=\"a4-de-hoek\" >A4-De Hoek</option><option value=\"de-parel\" >De Parel</option></select></div>\n      </div>\n      <p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:10px\">In het Rooster (Standaardrooster) kun je op de plek van een shift klikken om die shift een andere standaardplek te geven.</p>\n      <p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:10px\"><strong>Vaste afstand (km, enkele reis)</strong> Wedstrijden op AFC of ATC gebruiken deze vaste afstand. Er wordt niets berekend.</p>\n      <div class=\"grid2\">\n        <div><label style=\"margin-top:0\" for=\"locFixAFC\">AFC '34, Alkmaar</label><input type=\"number\" class=\"locInput\" id=\"locFixAFC\" min=\"0\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"\"></div>\n        <div><label style=\"margin-top:0\" for=\"locFixATC\">AZ Trainingscomplex, Wijdewormer</label><input type=\"number\" class=\"locInput\" id=\"locFixATC\" min=\"0\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\" id=\"apiKeysCard\">\n      <h2>API-sleutels</h2>\n      <p class=\"muted\">De sleutel voor OpenRouteService (afstand van uitwedstrijden) staat hier in de database, niet in de publieke GitHub-map. Alleen leden kunnen hem lezen; alleen de coördinator kan hem wijzigen.</p>\n      <p class=\"muted\">Nog geen OpenRouteService-sleutel: de afstand van uitwedstrijden wordt niet berekend.</p>\n      <label style=\"margin-top:0\" for=\"apiKeyOrs\">OpenRouteService-sleutel</label>\n      <input type=\"password\" id=\"apiKeyOrs\" autocomplete=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" placeholder=\"Nieuwe sleutel plakken\">\n      <div class=\"rowflex\" style=\"gap:6px;margin-top:8px\">\n        <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn small secondary\" id=\"apiKeyOrsSave\">Sleutel opslaan</button>\n        \n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\" id=\"impactCard\">\n    <h2>Impact-preview (pilot)</h2>\n    <p class=\"muted\">Pilot van 2 à 3 weken met de dagcoördinatoren. Aan: vóór het opslaan van een wijziging toont de app wat het effect is op het rooster. Er wordt niets van de preview opgeslagen. Uit: alles werkt zoals altijd, en er blijft geen data achter.</p>\n    <label class=\"chip\"><input type=\"checkbox\" id=\"impactToggle\" > Impact-preview aan</label>\n  </div>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h2>Beschikbaarheid chauffeurs (weekoverzicht)</h2>\n      <div style=\"overflow-x:auto\"><table class=\"avail\"><tr><th style=\"text-align:left\">Ouder</th><th colspan=\"2\">MA</th><th colspan=\"2\">DI</th><th colspan=\"2\">WO</th><th colspan=\"2\">DO</th><th colspan=\"2\">VR</th></tr>\n    <tr><th></th><th style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)\">H</th><th style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)\">T</th><th style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)\">H</th><th style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)\">T</th><th style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)\">H</th><th style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)\">T</th><th style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)\">H</th><th style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)\">T</th><th style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)\">H</th><th style=\"font-size:12px;color:var(--muted)\">T</th></tr><tr style=\"border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><td>Jan Jansen</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"availStd\">3</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"availStd\">3</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"muted\">–</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"muted\">–</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"muted\">–</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"muted\">–</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"availStd\">3</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"availStd\">3</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"muted\">–</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"muted\">–</span></td></tr><tr style=\"border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><td>Kees de Vries</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"availStd\">5</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"availStd\">5</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"muted\">–</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"muted\">–</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"availStd\">5</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"availStd\">5</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"muted\">–</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"muted\">–</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"muted\">–</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"muted\">–</span></td></tr><tr style=\"border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><td>Mo Bakker</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"muted\">–</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"muted\">–</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"availStd\">3</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"availStd\">3</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"muted\">–</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"muted\">–</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"availStd\">3</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"availStd\">3</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"muted\">–</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"muted\">–</span></td></tr><tr style=\"border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><td>Piet Pieters</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"availStd\">4</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"availStd\">4</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"availStd\">4</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"availStd\">4</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"muted\">–</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"muted\">–</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"availStd\">4</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"availStd\">4</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"muted\">–</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"muted\">–</span></td></tr><tr style=\"border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><td>Sanne Smit</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"muted\">–</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"muted\">–</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"muted\">–</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"muted\">–</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"muted\">–</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"muted\">–</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"muted\">–</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"muted\">–</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"muted\">–</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"muted\">–</span></td></tr><tr style=\"border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><td>Tom Visser</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"availStd\">3</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"availStd\">3</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"muted\">–</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"muted\">–</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"muted\">–</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"muted\">–</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"muted\">–</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"muted\">–</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"muted\">–</span></td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span class=\"muted\">–</span></td></tr></table></div>\n    <p class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\"><span class=\"availStd\">4</span> groen vlak = standaard beschikbaar. <span style=\"color:var(--backup);font-weight:500\">4</span> grijs cijfer = back-up (indien nodig). Cijfer = plek voor passagiers (niet de totale autocapaciteit). H = heen, T = terug.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h2>Planning-instellingen</h2>\n      <p class=\"muted\">Deze regels bepalen hoe combinaties in het Rooster worden voorgesteld. Wijzigingen worden automatisch opgeslagen.</p>\n      <div class=\"grid4\">\n        <div><label>Max. tijdsverschil voor 1 auto (uur)</label><input type=\"number\" id=\"setGap\" min=\"0.5\" step=\"0.5\" value=\"3\"></div>\n        <div><label>Rijtijd Aalsmeer→Alkmaar (min, vertrektijd heen)</label><input type=\"number\" id=\"setLead\" min=\"0\" step=\"5\" value=\"60\"></div>\n        <div><label>Marge reisvookeuren (min)</label><input type=\"number\" id=\"setPrefWindow\" min=\"0\" step=\"5\" value=\"30\"></div>\n        <div><label>Max. wachttijd om met eigen ouder te rijden (min)</label><input type=\"number\" id=\"setParentPrefWindow\" min=\"0\" step=\"5\" value=\"60\"></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h2>Wedstrijdkalenders (Google Calendar)</h2>\n      <p class=\"muted\">Deze agenda's voeden \"Wedstrijden deze week\" (Mijn week) en het tabblad Wedstrijden (29 dagen vooruit). Elke agenda moet openbaar (\"Make available to public\") staan — Google Calendar → tandwiel bij de agenda → Instellingen en delen → Toegangsrechten.</p>\n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn small secondary\" id=\"addMatchFeedBtn\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">+ Nieuwe kalender toevoegen</button>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn small secondary\" id=\"refreshMatchesBtn\" style=\"margin-top:8px\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" style=\"width:1em;height:1em;vertical-align:-0.15em;flex-shrink:0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M60 108a72 72 0 0 1 122-42l14 14M196 148a72 72 0 0 1-122 42l-14-14\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><polyline points=\"180,50 182,80 152,80\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><polyline points=\"76,206 74,176 104,176\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/></svg> Nu verversen</button>\n      \n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h2>Meldingen bij gewijzigde tijden</h2>\n      <p class=\"muted\">Als een ouder de aankomst- of ophaaltijd van een dochter aanpast, zie je dat bovenaan het Rooster (met een teller op het Rooster-tabje). Zet hieronder ook meldingen van je browser aan om een seintje te krijgen terwijl de app open staat op de achtergrond.</p>\n      <p class=\"muted\">Deze browser ondersteunt geen meldingen.</p>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <h2>Beheerderstools</h2>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"btn danger\" id=\"seedPdf\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 256 256\" style=\"width:1em;height:1em;vertical-align:-0.15em;flex-shrink:0\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M56 64h144l-12 144a8 8 0 0 1-8 8H76a8 8 0 0 1-8-8Z\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"/><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"64\" x2=\"216\" y2=\"64\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M96 64V48a16 16 0 0 1 16-16h32a16 16 0 0 1 16 16v16\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"16\"/></svg> Alles wissen &amp; PDF-gegevens laden</button>\n      <p id=\"seedMsg\" class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\"></p>\n    </div>"
}
